#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "56_Kondo"
msgid "I'm sorry! Please, no more, no more!"
msgstr "¡Lo siento! ¡Por favor, para, no más!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "68_Kondo"
msgid "I swear I won't do anythin' to get in your way again. Just please, let this one go!"
msgstr "Te juro que no volveré a meterme en tu camino. ¡Por favor, déjame ir!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "80_Akaishi"
msgid "Listen here, Kondo-san, maybe our work does get in the way of your business."
msgstr "Escúchame bien, Kondo-san, capaz nuestro trabajo sí interfiera en su negocio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "92_Akaishi"
msgid "You can hate me all you like, but if you got somethin' to say, don't pussy out. You come talk to the man in charge!"
msgstr "Puedes odiarme lo que tanto quieras, pero si tienes algo que decir, no seas cobarde. ¡Y ve a hablar con el jefe!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "104_Akaishi"
msgid "Got that, asshole!?"
msgstr "¡¿Te quedo claro?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "116_Kondo"
msgid "Yes... Yes, sir!"
msgstr "¡S-Si señor!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "128_Akaishi"
msgid "You ever try this bullshit again and you won't get off with just a beating!"
msgstr "Si vuelves a jodernos una paliza, no te salvará."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "152_Akaishi"
msgid "How long you gonna keep messin' around with this yakuza crap, anyhow? You decide you want out, you come talk to me anytime."
msgstr "¿Cuánto tiempo seguirás con esta mierda yakuza? Si te retiras, ven a hablar conmigo cuando quieras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "164_Akaishi"
msgid "Tanimura-san, let's get the hell outta here."
msgstr "Tanimura-san, vamonos de aqui..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "176_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah, okay... Kondo-san, I'd watch what I do if I were you."
msgstr "Ok... Kondo-san, si fuera tú, andaría con más cuidado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Kondo"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

